'''Windy''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 2.1 Update|Version 2.1]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals]] and [[AIR BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|AIR BUSTERS]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] increases her attack power, health, range and speed. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]] increases range, attack frequency, speed, reduces attack foreswing, and gains [[Insane Damage|insane damage]] instead of [[Massive Damage|massive damage]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]].

